{
  "name": "Building Permits Leads: US City Permits and Violations, $1.5/1k to Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Building Permits Leads: US City Permits and Violations, $1.5/1k\nBuilding permits leads from official city open-data portals (Chicago, NYC, LA, SF, Seattle, Austin, Baton Rouge, Montgomery Co. MD, Cincinnati). Type, status, dates, valuation, property address,...\n\n**Setup (about 3 minutes)**\n1. Credentials > New > *Header Auth*. Name it `Apify API token`. Header name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN` (token: Apify Console > Settings > Integrations).\n2. Open *Append to Google Sheet*, connect Google Sheets OAuth2, set your spreadsheet (replace `YOUR_SHEET_ID`) and tab.\n3. Edit the JSON body in *Run Apify actor* to your own filters (see https://apify.com/transparent_meteorite/building-permits-leads).\n4. Click *Execute workflow* to test, then activate. The schedule trigger runs daily at 07:00.\n\nMaintained by the author of this actor. Pay-per-result pricing; the free Apify plan credit covers a trial. Sample input uses a small result limit.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "80a775ed0a87",
      "name": "Setup notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 7
            }
          ]
        }
